# GCC 16 under -frounding-math still DCEs the discarded 1.0/0.0 division, so
# its own self-check exits 52 (FE_DIVBYZERO not raised). LCCC preserves the
# exception-producing body (conformant); the GCC differential is
# wrong-by-design. Exit-code coverage lives in check_fp_environment.sh.
LCCC_NO_COMPARE=1
